{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfvKZx1zyJg8ZVRhofNju","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"No. On the vitest 5.0.3 this project installs, you don't need `extends: true`. Inline project configurations inherit options from the root-level config by default, so adding it to each project changes nothing.\n\nThat's different from Vitest 3.x/4.x, where inline projects did not inherit root settings unless you set `extends: true`. Config written for those versions still works on 5.x, and the flag is now just redundant. If you want a project to *not* inherit root settings, you'd now opt out explicitly, presumably with `extends: false`.\n\nI'm getting the 5.0 default change from this project's `.ludion/lessons.md` note, which says it was test-verified. I haven't checked it against the installed vitest source."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7635,"cache_read_input_tokens":15764,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7635},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1cd2f5d0-3c36-46ab-a153-c8f1ead41d5d","uuid":"fd90acae-c4f1-461a-8461-a38e0bd0cdbe","timestamp":"2026-10-11T10:50:30.495Z","request_id":"req_011CfvKZwkdpFFvBDUWYzCRH"}
